OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785773923
OL,3,CMultiple crews tackle scrap yard fire
OL,4,Cseen for miles
OL,6,FFirefighters in Doncaster have been
OL,7,Ftackling a large blaze on an
OL,8,Findustrial estate in Hatfield.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to a
OL,11,Fscrap yard on Bootham Lane on the
OL,12,Fafternoon on Saturday August 1 and
OL,13,Fremained there overnight through to
OL,14,FSunday.
OL,16,FThose living nearby have been asked to
OL,17,Fkeep their doors and windows closed as
OL,18,Fthick plumes of black smoke were seen
OL,19,Fbillowing into the air for miles
OL,20,Faround.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/2
