PN,33402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785773923
OL,3,CMultiple crews tackle scrap yard fire
OL,4,Cseen for miles
OL,6,FAt its height the fire required the
OL,7,Fattendance of nine engines and people
OL,8,Fwere asked to stay away from the area.
OL,10,FIn an update this morning, South
OL,11,FYorkshire Fire & Rescue posted: "Well
OL,12,Fdone to all our firefighters, officers
OL,13,Fand Control room staff for their
OL,14,Fresponse to this very significant fire.
OL,16,F"We have also been supported by South
OL,17,FYorkshire Police, Yorkshire Ambulance
OL,18,FService and West Yorkshire Fire &
OL,19,FRescue in our response."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/2
